      },
      "summary": "A very curly script that looks like no other European language. Signs often add Latin letters next to it. Don't mix it up with Indian scripts, and expect some Russia-like infrastructure.",
      "differs": [
        {
          "country": "IN",
          "how": "Indian scripts look fairly different from this swirly script"
        }
      ]
    },
